#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Ride with Pals eliminates disorganized activities, scattered communication "
"across messaging apps, headaches with selling club merchandise to members, "
"lack of a trusted marketplace for second-hand gear, and manual chaos in "
"member and membership fee management."
msgstr ""
"Ride with Pals elimina le uscite disorganizzate, i messaggi dispersi su app "
"diverse, le difficoltà nella vendita di completi sociali, la mancanza di un "
"mercatino dell'usato affidabile e il disordine nella contabilità dei soci."

#: src/features/landing/components/HeroSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Ride With Pals helps cycling and running clubs, shops and local organisers "
"manage activities, members, payments and communication in one place."
msgstr ""
"Ride With Pals aiuta club ciclistici e podistici, negozi e organizzatori "
"locali a gestire uscite, soci, quote e comunicazioni in un unico posto."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid ""
"Ride with Pals is an all-in-one platform for cycling, running, and triathlon"
" clubs that lets you organize activities, manage members, collect membership"
" fees, sell products, and build a community - all in one place."
msgstr ""
"Ride with Pals è la piattaforma integrata per club ciclistici, podistici e "
"di triathlon che permette di organizzare uscite, gestire tesseramenti, "
"incassare quote, vendere prodotti societari e creare spirito di squadra in "
"un unico posto."

#: src/features/ClubSide/TermsConditions.tsx
msgid ""
"Ride With Pals is not liable for any injuries, damages, or losses incurred "
"during activities organized through the platform. Cycling involves inherent "
"risks, and participants assume all responsibility."
msgstr ""
"Ride With Pals non è responsabile per eventuali lesioni, danni o perdite "
"subite durante le attività organizzate attraverso la piattaforma. Andare in "
"bicicletta comporta rischi intrinseci e i partecipanti si assumono ogni "
"responsabilità."

#: src/features/public-club/pages/RideJoining.tsx
msgid ""
"Ride With Pals maintains a zero-tolerance policy for unsportsmanlike "
"behavior, harassment, or unsafe reckless maneuvers."
msgstr ""
"Ride With Pals mantiene una politica di tolleranza zero per comportamenti "
"antisportivi, molestie o manovre avventate e pericolose."

